OL,3,GNEWSAHuge data centre planned between
OL,4,Avillages
OL,5,
OL,6,FEarly designs for a huge data centre
OL,7,Fcomplex will go on show to villagers
OL,8,Fwho would be living near the
OL,9,Fdevelopment if it ever goes ahead.
OL,11,FDeveloper Tract wants to create the
OL,12,Feight-building giant, which it calls
OL,13,FDurham Technology Park, on land between
OL,14,Fthe villages of South Hetton, Murton
OL,15,Fand Easington Lane in County Durham.
OL,17,FThe project is still in the initial
OL,18,Fdesign stage and the company "does not
OL,19,Fknow at this time" who might operate
OL,20,Fthe facility.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
